00:23:41.203 --> 00:23:42.155
- If you're saying if
it feels good, do it?

00:23:42.155 --> 00:23:42.988
Are you a hedonist?

00:23:42.988 --> 00:23:44.060
- I don't care who you are.

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:44.893
I don't care where you are.

00:23:44.893 --> 00:23:46.060
If you watch "Good Mythical Morning,"

00:23:46.060 --> 00:23:49.600
I believe that you will
