and why you might want to wear it on a hat

00:23:59.500 --> 00:24:00.333
or a shirt or a hoodie,

00:24:00.333 --> 00:24:05.229
because "Good Mythical
Morning" makes you feel good.

00:24:05.229 --> 00:24:08.897
No matter who you are or what you believe.

00:24:08.897 --> 00:24:12.030
- Yeah, and fittingly,
this stuff does feel good.

00:24:12.030 --> 00:24:13.110
I mean, I don't know about that hat,

00:24:13.110 --> 00:24:15.240
but like the hoodie feels really good.

00:24:15.240 --> 00:24:18.640
Like we pride ourselves on
